        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral: Steam Edition is a sandbox about exploration and freedom. Its central mechanic is astral projection: leaving your body to explore the world from a new perspective and interact with what’s around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> – Open-world freeplay with money and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Build</strong> – Unlimited items and full creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> – Focused on vehicles, with cars spawning at the Boot and Rusty Nail shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles can be bought with in-game currency or spawned freely in Free Build. Shops exist as part of the pause menu, with more systems to come in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps are currently available: Islands, Crazy Road, and Flatland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a single developer named Daniel, with the help of tools like Universal Vehicle Controller by Perfect Games. Astral will keep expanding as I continue to learn and improve. Your support means a lot.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral: Steam Edition is a sandbox about exploration and freedom. Its central mechanic is astral projection: leaving your body to explore the world from a new perspective and interact with what’s around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> – Open-world freeplay with money and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Build</strong> – Unlimited items and full creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> – Focused on vehicles, with cars spawning at the Boot and Rusty Nail shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles can be bought with in-game currency or spawned freely in Free Build. Shops exist as part of the pause menu, with more systems to come in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps are currently available: Islands, Crazy Road, and Flatland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a single developer named Daniel, with the help of tools like Universal Vehicle Controller by Perfect Games. Astral will keep expanding as I continue to learn and improve. Your support means a lot.</p>",
        "short_description": "A sandbox about freedom and creativity. Leave your body through astral projection, drive cars, and explore unique maps across different game modes like Sandbox, Free Drive, and Free Build.",
